    propertyPath: _menuButton
    value: 
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _algCanva
    value: 
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _diagramScreen
    value: 
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.size
    value: 9
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[0].missionState
    value: 1
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[0].missionStep
    value: 0
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[0].lines.Array.size
    value: 7
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[0]'
    value: "Ol\xE1, eu sou a S223!"
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[1]'
    value: "Ol\xE1! Este \xE9 o Furbot. Ele est\xE1 quebrado e incompleto."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[2]'
    value: "Nossa miss\xE3o at\xE9 o final do jogo \xE9 conseguir consertar e montar
      o Furbot por completo."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[3]'
    value: Para resolver esse desafio, vamos usar o <color=Green>Pensamento Computacional</color=Green>.
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[4]'
    value: "<color=Green>Pensamento Computacional</color=Green> \xE9 o jeito de resolver
      problemas dividindo-os em passos simples e organizados."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[5]'
    value: "Mas vamos come\xE7ar desmontando o Furbot."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[6]'
    value: "Sua miss\xE3o:  Vamos desmontar o Furbot! Para isso, segure uma pe\xE7a
      em cada  m\xE3o e puxe para separ\xE1-las."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[1].missionState
    value: 1
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[1].missionStep
    value: 1
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[1].lines.Array.size
    value: 2
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[0]'
    value: "Muito bem! Agora temos que armazenar essas pe\xE7as em nosso computador,
      Vamos usar nosso scanner para isso."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[1]'
    value: "Sua miss\xE3o: Escanear todas as pe\xE7as! Feche a m\xE3o para segurar
      o Scanner, aponte para a pe\xE7a e aperte o gatilho."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[2].missionState
    value: 1
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[2].missionStep
    value: 2
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[2].lines.Array.size
    value: 2
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[0]'
    value: "Isso! Agora podemos imprimir todas as pe\xE7as pelo nosso computador."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[1]'
    value: "O <color=Green>Pensamento Computacional</color=Green> nos ajuda a resolver
      problemas dif\xEDceis usando <color=red>4 pilares</color>. Vamos conhecer um
      por um!"
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[3].missionState
    value: 2
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[3].missionStep
    value: 0
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[3].lines.Array.size
    value: 5
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[3].lines.Array.data[0]'
    value: "O primeiro pilar \xE9 a <color=green>Decomposi\xE7\xE3o</color>!"
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[3].lines.Array.data[1]'
    value: "A <color=green>Decomposi\xE7\xE3o</color> significa <color=yellow>dividir
      um problema complexo em partes menores</color>. "
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[3].lines.Array.data[2]'
    value: "Assim \xE9 mais f\xE1cil solucionar parte por parte at\xE9 completar
      tudo!"
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[3].lines.Array.data[3]'
    value: "Aplicando isso na nossa montagem, faremos o trabalho por etapas: <color=yellow>Bra\xE7o, 
      Cabe\xE7a e, por \xFAltimo, o Furbot completo."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[3].lines.Array.data[4]'
    value: "<color=green>Sua miss\xE3o:</color> No computador, v\xE1 para a aba <color=yellow>'Pe\xE7as'</color>,
      procure as que pertencem ao <color=yellow>Bra\xE7o, imprima e coloque na mesa</color>. "
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[4].missionState
    value: 2
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[4].missionStep
    value: 1
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[4].lines.Array.size
    value: 4
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[4].lines.Array.data[0]'
    value: "Isso a\xED! Olhando para a mesa agora fica muito mais f\xE1cil montar
      o bra\xE7o, n\xE9?"
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[4].lines.Array.data[1]'
    value: "O pilar da <color=green>Abstra\xE7\xE3o</color>: separar e focar nas
      informa\xE7\xF5es que envolvem o problema atual."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[4].lines.Array.data[2]'
    value: "Aqui voc\xEA separou as pe\xE7as: <color=red>Bra\xE7o e m\xE3o</color>.
      <color=yellow>Olhar s\xF3 para o necess\xE1rio facilita na hora de resolver
      o problema atual."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[4].lines.Array.data[3]'
    value: "<color=green>Sua miss\xE3o</color>: Conecte a <color=yellow>M\xE3o ao
      Bra\xE7o</color> e depois <color=yellow>Escaneie</color>."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[5].missionState
    value: 2
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[5].missionStep
    value: 2
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[5].lines.Array.size
    value: 6
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[5].lines.Array.data[0]'
    value: "Isso! Agora, pela tela de <color=green>\"Diagramas\"</color>, j\xE1 podemos
      imprimir o <color=green>bra\xE7o completo</color> de uma vez."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[5].lines.Array.data[1]'
    value: "Vamos repetir o mesmo processo para montar a cabe\xE7a."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[5].lines.Array.data[2]'
    value: "Mas antes, est\xE1 vendo essa tela menor na sua frente? Ela est\xE1 representando
      o pilar do <color=green>\"Algoritmo\"</color>."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[5].lines.Array.data[3]'
    value: "o <color=green>Algoritmo</color> nada mais \xE9 do que uma <color=yellow>lista
      de passo a passo.</color>"
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[5].lines.Array.data[4]'
    value: "Como uma receita de bolo: <color=yellow>voc\xEA segue os passos na ordem
      exata para dar certo."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[5].lines.Array.data[5]'
    value: "<color=green>Sua miss\xE3o</color>: Use a <color=yellow>Abstra\xE7\xE3o</color>
      para imprimir as pe\xE7as da <color=yellow>Cabe\xE7a</color>. Depois, monte
      e escaneie."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[6].missionState
    value: 2
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[6].missionStep
    value: 3
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[6].lines.Array.size
    value: 3
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[6].lines.Array.data[0]'
    value: "Voc\xEA percebeu que sabia onde cada pe\xE7a se encaixava?\nEsse \xE9
      o pilar do <color=green>\"Reconhecimento de Padr\xF5es\"</color>."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[6].lines.Array.data[1]'
    value: "Esse \xE9 o pilar do \"Reconhecimento de Padr\xF5es\", ele nos ensina
      a olhar para o que j\xE1 aprendemos antes e aplicar em problemas semelhantes."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[6].lines.Array.data[2]'
    value: "No nosso caso voc\xEA consegue saber as pe\xE7as que pertencem a <color=yellow>cabe\xE7a</color>,
      pois j\xE1 as viu antes."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[7].missionState
    value: 3
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[7].missionStep
    value: 0
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[7].lines.Array.size
    value: 6
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[7].lines.Array.data[0]'
    value: "Agora temos a cabe\xE7a pronta para imprimir!"
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[7].lines.Array.data[1]'
    value: "Olhando para o <color=green>Algoritmo</color>, fica mais f\xE1cil completar
      a tarefa sem se perder no caminho."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[7].lines.Array.data[2]'
    value: "Observe que listas diferentes podem estar certas. Mas, <color=red>cuidado!</color>
      \xC0s vezes, trocar a ordem de um dos itens pode gerar um erro."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[7].lines.Array.data[3]'
    value: "Agora vamos para a nossa \xFAltima etapa! Utilizaremos tudo o que aprendemos
      para montar o <color=yellow>Furbot!</color>"
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[7].lines.Array.data[4]'
    value: "Observe que cada passo que voc\xEA fizer ser\xE1 registrado na tela de
      <color=green>algoritmo</color>, assim teremos a nossa pr\xF3pria lista de passos!"
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[7].lines.Array.data[5]'
    value: "<color=green>Sua miss\xE3o</color>: Monte o <color=yellow>Furbot</color>.
      Utilize as telas de <color=yellow>'Pe\xE7as'</color> e <color=yellow>'Diagramas'</color>
      para imprimir os itens e, ao terminar, use o Scanner."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[8].missionState
    value: 4
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[8].missionStep
    value: 0
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _missionDialogues.Array.data[8].lines.Array.size
    value: 7
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[8].lines.Array.data[0]'
    value: "<color=green>Parab\xEAns</color>, voc\xEA conseguiu completar sua miss\xE3o
      de montar o Furbot e aprendeu sobre o Pensamento Computacional!"
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[8].lines.Array.data[1]'
    value: "Para completar essa miss\xE3o, voc\xEA usou os quatro pilares do Pensamento
      Computacional."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[8].lines.Array.data[2]'
    value: "Com a <color=green>Decomposi\xE7\xE3o</color>, voc\xEA dividiu o rob\xF4
      em partes menores para facilitar a montagem."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[8].lines.Array.data[3]'
    value: "Com a <color=green>Abstra\xE7\xE3o</color>, voc\xEA focou apenas nas
      pe\xE7as necess\xE1rias de cada etapa e ignorou o resto."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[8].lines.Array.data[4]'
    value: "Com o <color=green>Padr\xE3o</color>, voc\xEA reutilizou experi\xEAncias
      aprendidas para concluir etapas do jogo."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[8].lines.Array.data[5]'
    value: "E com os <color=green>Algoritmos</color>, voc\xEA seguiu uma lista de
      passos para completar a miss\xE3o sem se perder ou distanciar do objetivo."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: '_missionDialogues.Array.data[8].lines.Array.data[6]'
    value: "Miss\xE3o conclu\xEDda! Agora voc\xEA j\xE1 sabe organizar ideias e resolver
      problemas como um cientista da computa\xE7\xE3o."
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _armDiagram
    value: 
    objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 694a2c3e89e82b949b5dfe78f92db7fe, type: 2}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _headDiagram
    value: 
    objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b9c2693454f90064caf2df3e8fdf7ab0, type: 2}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _furbotDiagram
    value: 
    objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 604f5c8de29017448b89ee814378eb24, type: 2}
  - target: {fileID: 0}
    propertyPath: _iniciarMissao3Liberada
    value: 0
    objectReference: {fileID: 0}
  m_ExcludedProperties: []
  m_CoupledType:
    m_NativeTypeID: 0
    m_ManagedTypePPtr: {fileID: 0}
    m_ManagedTypeFallback: 
  m_CoupledProperties: []
